rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  rectangle "geom\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>" <<Boundary-Z2VvbQ==>> {
    rectangle "==Feature list\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe serialisable feature list (single source of truth for code and GUI), its operations and validation, parameter expressions, printing as Rust builder calls, and the error type." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.geom.Featurelist
    rectangle "==Evaluation\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nThe Evaluator turns a feature list into an evaluated model at a chosen tier with a cache; scenes instantiate profiles with transforms and patterns; change detection between evaluations for sweeps." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.geom.Evaluation
    rectangle "==2D kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nPrimitives, planar curves, the planar arrangement of all boundary pieces and the evaluated region complex." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.geom.2Dkernel
    rectangle "==3D kernel\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nPrismatic models as a layer stack, general planar-faced solids, and the edges and vertices of a 3D model." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.geom.3Dkernel
    rectangle "==Queries and selectors\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nExact queries on an evaluated model, serialisable selectors, the LabelMap between names and the integer labels solvers consume, and simulation operations as data." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.geom.Queriesandselectors
    rectangle "==Display tessellation\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nTessellation for the viewport and picking only, never for meshing." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.geom.Displaytessellation
    rectangle "==Math helpers\n<size:16>[Component: Rust modules]</size>\n\nSmall vector, box and similarity-transform helpers." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as nyx.geom.Mathhelpers
  }

}

